      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在这段时光中，\n深刻地感受到了\n与八重无敌之间无可取代的情谊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ded90d063ed64c062523ca65639f999316d89bb2437094efba7a752c94e95c7",
